{"ref":"BDB, אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר","hw":"אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר</span></big>  (<span dir=\"rtl\">־עֶ֑זרֶ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:2\" href=\"/Genesis.15.2\">Gn 15:2</a> +) <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God is help</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:4\" href=\"/Exodus.18.4\">Ex 18:4</a>; v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֶלְעָזָר\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶלְעָזָר\", dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְעָזָר</a> infr., <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲזַרְאֵל</span>, Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">אשמנעזר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בעלעזר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עזרבעל</span><strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  Abraham’s steward <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֱלִיעֶ֑זֶר)</span>, a Damascene <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:2\" href=\"/Genesis.15.2\">Gn 15:2</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  a son of Moses <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:4\" href=\"/Exodus.18.4\">Ex 18:4</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.15\">1 Ch 23:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.17\">17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.8\">1 Ch 7:8</a>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  several priests <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.24\">1 Ch 15:24</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.25\">1 Ch 26:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:18\" href=\"/Ezra.10.18\">Ezr 10:18</a>.<br><strong>e.</strong>  Reubenite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.16\">1 Ch 27:16</a>.<br><strong>f.</strong>  prophet in time of Jehoshaphat <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:37\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.37\">2 Ch 20:37</a>.<br><strong>g.</strong>  Levite chief <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:16\" href=\"/Ezra.8.16\">Ezr 8:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:23\" href=\"/Ezra.10.23\">10:23</a>.<br><strong>h.</strong>  son of Harim Ezr. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:31\" href=\"/Ezra.10.31\">10:31</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלִיעָם","prev":"BDB, אֶלְיָסָף"}